<title>UK: Capital yr pretax slips, dividend unchanged.</title>
<headline>Capital yr pretax slips, dividend unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.26		   vs 8.68</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.125		  vs 8.125</p>
<p> Exceptional costs	2.8		    vs 1.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     9.2		    vs 13.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   43.1		   vs 51.4</p>
<p>NOTE - London luxury casino operator Capital Corporation Plc said it had reported its 1996 results as part of its latest response to a hostile takeover bid launched by London Clubs International Plc, which it is urging its shareholders to reject.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
